# Shared Memory

- Shared memory vault: `{VAULT_PATH}`
- Default language: 中文
- If a task needs recovery, runtime state, long-term preferences, or tool paths, use `obsidian-memory` first
- Do not keep parallel runtime notes under `{CODEX_HOME}`

## Read Order

- Orientation: `首页.md` -> `工作流\项目约定.md` -> `配置\系统信息.md` -> `配置\用户偏好.md` -> `配置\工具与组件.md`
- Resume: `运行时\恢复索引.md` -> `运行时\当前任务.md` -> `运行时\tasks\<task-id>.md` -> `运行时\中断任务.md` -> `运行时\上次会话.md`

## Writeback

- Single-writer model: only the entry agent writes shared pointer files
- Codex writes only `docs/tasks/<task-id>/*` and `运行时\tasks\<task-id>.md`
- If Codex is the active entry host for the task, it must also update shared pointer files and refresh `运行时\恢复索引.md` according to the shared memory protocol
- New items go to `运行时\收件箱.md` first
